<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="eyebrow">Roco-delay</view>
    <view class="title">洛克王国通行证传火匹配</view>
    <view class="subtitle">平台只做信息匹配，不参与现金交易。你正在匹配或已匹配的传火/接火单会展示在首页顶部。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card match-card">
    <view class="section-title">我的匹配进度</view>
    <view class="hint">展示你还没有完成或关闭的匹配单，点击可进入详情。</view>

    <view wx:if="{{activePosts.length > 0}}">
      <view
        wx:for="{{activePosts}}"
        wx:key="_id"
        class="active-order"
        data-id="{{item._id}}"
        bindtap="goDetail"
      >
        <view>
          <view class="active-top">
            <view class="badge">{{item.flowStatusLabel}}</view>
            <view wx:if="{{item.status === 'matched' || item.status === 'contacted'}}" class="match-count">已为你锁定对方</view>
            <view wx:else class="match-count muted">等待系统批量匹配</view>
          </view>
          <view class="active-title">{{item.passTypeLabel}} · {{item.petLabel}}</view>
          <view class="active-meta">{{item.statusLabel}} · 洛克 UID：{{item.rocoUid}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="arrow">详情</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:else class="empty-inline">
      暂无匹配中或进行中的传火/接火单。可以从底部“发布”Tab 创建新的匹配单。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="summary-grid">
    <view class="summary-card summary-wide">
      <view class="summary-num">{{summary.completed}}</view>
      <view class="summary-label">累积完成</view>
    </view>
    <view class="summary-card">
      <view class="summary-num">{{summary.buyers}}</view>
      <view class="summary-label">待接火</view>
    </view>
    <view class="summary-card">
      <view class="summary-num">{{summary.sellers}}</view>
      <view class="summary-label">可传火</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="list-head">
    <view>
      <view class="section-title">最新发布</view>
      <view class="hint">最近发布的接火/传火信息，包含匹配中与已匹配。</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="filters">
    <picker
      mode="selector"
      range="{{passTypes}}"
      range-key="label"
      value="{{latestPassTypeIndex}}"
      bindchange="onLatestPassTypeChange"
    >
      <view class="filter-pill">{{latestPassTypeLabel}}</view>
    </picker>
    <picker
      mode="selector"
      range="{{pets}}"
      range-key="label"
      value="{{latestPetIndex}}"
      bindchange="onLatestPetChange"
    >
      <view class="filter-pill">{{latestPetLabel}}</view>
    </picker>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载首页数据...</view>

  <view wx:elif="{{latestPosts.length === 0}}" class="empty">
    <view class="empty-title">暂无符合条件的发布</view>
    <view class="empty-desc">可以调整筛选条件，或从底部“发布”Tab 创建新的接火/传火信息。</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:else class="post-list">
    <view
      wx:for="{{latestPosts}}"
      wx:key="_id"
      class="post-card"
      data-id="{{item._id}}"
      bindtap="goDetail"
    >
      <view class="post-top">
        <view class="badge">{{item.roleLabel}}</view>
        <view class="status">{{item.flowStatusLabel}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="post-title">{{item.passTypeLabel}} · {{item.petLabel}}</view>
      <view class="post-meta">洛克 UID：{{item.rocoUid}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.rocoName}}" class="post-meta">昵称：{{item.rocoName}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.remark}}" class="remark">{{item.remark}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
